# The review path per area.
#
# There is one owner, so every path below names the same reviewer. The value of this file is the map:
# which paths belong to which repository, and which of them are cross-repository contracts. A change to
# a contract needs the repositories that consume it, not only the one that holds it.

# The default owner for everything in this repository.
/* @Nomadcxx

# The catalogue. The shell reads it to list the plugins it can install, and the release
# workflow opens a pull request carrying the regenerated file.
/catalog.json @Nomadcxx
/catalog-meta.json @Nomadcxx
/tools/catalog/ @Nomadcxx

# The plugins themselves. Each one is a separate program the shell runs as a
# supervised process.
/plugins/ @Nomadcxx

# The manifest schema and the validation that goes with it.
/internal/ @Nomadcxx
/tools/validate-manifests/ @Nomadcxx
